# Copy to .env.local for development, and add the same variable in
# Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables for production.

# Web3Forms access key — decides which inbox the contact form delivers to.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com by entering the destination address
# (schaefer@talentbegleiter.de); the key arrives by email.
#
# Safe to expose: it identifies the inbox, it does not authorise anything.
# Leave it unset and the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
